eads) - 15.34 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n#102648 implemented a few new options to make it so no matter how little text is trimmed, an ellipse character is always added. But it makes an ellipsis get added even if no text is trimmed.\n\n<img width=\"625\" height=\"286\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6841c7e-a9e5-401a-9f96-df0346508ea6\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a label, add a minimum size to give it enough space, set its ellipsis mode, and type something short. No matter what you type, there will be an ellipsis at the end.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A too simple","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110389/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}